#: ../../genrst/index.rst:6
msgid "OpenMV MicroPython differences from CPython"
msgstr "OpenMV MicroPythonin erot CPythoniin"

#: ../../genrst/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"MicroPython implements Python 3.4 and some select features of Python 3.5 and"
" above.  The sections below describe the current status of these features."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython toteuttaa Python 3.4:n sekä joitakin valittuja ominaisuuksia "
"Python 3.5:stä ja uudemmista versioista. Alla olevat osiot kuvaavat näiden "
"ominaisuuksien nykyistä tilaa."

#: ../../genrst/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"For the features of Python that are implemented by MicroPython, there are "
"sometimes differences in their behaviour compared to standard Python.  The "
"operations listed in the sections below produce conflicting results in "
"MicroPython when compared to standard Python."
msgstr ""
"MicroPythonin toteuttamissa Python-ominaisuuksissa on toisinaan eroja "
"verrattuna standardiin Pythoniin. Alla olevissa osioissa luetellut "
"operaatiot tuottavat ristiriitaisia tuloksia MicroPythonissa verrattuna "
"standardiin Pythoniin."
